JavaScript GIF parser and player bookmarklet. See <http://slbkbs.org/jsgif>.

## Build

Use podman to build on an image with the build toolchain.

### Make image

```
podman build -t jsgif-build -f Containerfile . 2>&1
```

### Run build in image

```
podman run --rm -v "$PWD":/src:Z jsgif-build > bookmarklet.txt 2> build.err; echo "exit=$?"; echo "--- stderr ---"; cat build.err; echo "--- output size ---"; wc -c bookmarklet.txt; echo "--- head ---"; cut -c1-120 bookmarklet.txt
```

### Make bookmarklet

Successful output will be in bookmarklet.txt. Copy and paste it into a new browser bookmark in the url/location field.
